<item><title>Wagner mercenaries fail to dislodge rebels in Kwango</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cf/wagner-mercenaries-fail-to-dislodge-rebels-in-kwango-ce63d0/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cf/wagner-mercenaries-fail-to-dislodge-rebels-in-kwango-ce63d0/</guid><category>Central African Republic</category><description>Russian Wagner Group fighters returned to Bangui without removing armed elements suspected of being former UPC fighters from the Kwango area.</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 06:00:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cf.jpg" length="41097" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cf.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
